  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe and Dignified Transfer of Migrants Landed in Lampedusa to Other Reception Centres in Italy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at defining easy-to-activate tools to coordinate efficient responses &#x2013; among the different stakeholders &#x2013; in the territories affected by emergency situations created by the massive, sudden arrival of migrants. The even application of the response throughout the territory will be ensured by assigning the Department of Civil Liberties and Immigration at the Ministry of Interior with the leadership and ownership of the relevant coordination mechanism, including through the assignment of a reference official/coordinator stationed in Lampedusa.</narrative>
  </description>
